		{"id": "note", "type": "text", "text": "**Note.** Apple ⚠️ cells produce binaries that compile but cannot be signed — Apple's SDK/Gatekeeper requires macOS for signing. Useful for sanity-check compilation only.", "x": -480, "y": 20, "width": 1120, "height": 80, "color": "3"}
